   252	### 4.2 THEOREM RADIUS-ORDER
   253	
   254	Write `P_j := V_j(n - M_j) - d_j > 0` (positivity is Def 5.1(2)) and
   255	`Q_j := V_j(n - M_{j-1}) - d_j > P_j`.
   256	
   257	> **THEOREM RADIUS-ORDER (new).** Along the major tower,
   258	> ```text
   259	>     lambda_g(delta_r)  =  - n * prod_{j=r+1}^{s} P_j / Q_j
   260	>                        =  - n (1 - delta_r)(n - M_s - 1)/(n - M_r) ,
