   281	### 4.3 LEMMA DETECTOR-NULL — Moh §6 supplies the minor discs, in full
   282	
   283	> **LEMMA DETECTOR-NULL.** Let `E` be a minor disc (any level `r >= 2`). Then
   284	> every `g`-root in `E` contributes **0** to `N`.
