   293	`max(0, -lambda_f(delta^0)) = 0`. ∎
   294	
   295	This is Moh's own reading of his §6: "the roots of `g, T_1, ..., T_{r-1}` in it are
   296	**all distributed proportionally according to the `y`-degrees up to the uncertainty
   297	of `2^0 = 1`**" (`moh.txt:2874-2884`) — the "uncertainty at `2^0`" being exactly
   298	the frontier. **Consequence:** the `Sn` non-proper places of PLACE-LEDGER are
   299	exactly the frontier balls inside minor discs; the `kappa` proper places are
   300	exactly those under bottom-major discs.
