+## 5. Decisive desk experiment and strongest attacks
+
+I ran two read-only queries on the reviewed `box/moh_skeleton_N.py` enumerator; no repository file was written. The first counted branch-robust groups with `4 <= U_rob < 5` at the MOH-SHARP-2 degrees:
