+# Blind ideation submission — round 20260902T1608Z — Sol 5.6 ultra
+
+Charged packet SHA-256: `ab66bd6b87dc035740325c309349ec8d52a5963b6b1a0a6e0e53a34f74715af3` (verified before reading). Frozen campaign basis: `7f7c0306768d`. Scope: blind full-spectrum response to `OPEN[UPPER-TO-FLOOR]`; banked reports only; no `jc2-lean`; no canonical-ledger edits.
